    "text": "KBTX.com\nwebsite\nGrimes County, Texas\nGrimes County man sentenced for causing deadly crash in stolen car\nBy Rusty Surette,\n2 hours agoANDERSON, Texas (KBTX) - A Grimes County man has been sentenced to the maximum punishment for a deadly crash that followed a home burglary and left one person dead and another seriously injured. Raul Armando Bonilla, 61, pleaded guilty Tuesday to charges of Intoxication Manslaughter and Burglary of a Habitation,...\n2",
